ext): Clean up.\nc6abd1e40 [autofit] Fix integer overflow.\ne07e56c7f [gxvar] Speed up handling of deltas in `ItemVariationStore`. (3/3)\n86ab14e03 [gxvar] Speed up handling of deltas in `ItemVariationStore`. (2/3)\nfe6854ba5 [gxvar] Speed up handling of deltas in `ItemVariationStore`. (1/3)\n8eae03992 Lift `FT_Int64` type to global (internal) FreeType use.\nb8444f2fb [gxvar] Move scalar computation into its own function.\n57a873045 [autofit] Make the accent database work for more glyphs (again).",
